{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You Are Circle is a roguelite top-down shooter with vector-graphics reminiscent of old arcade classics from a time before pixels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You control Circle, a circular vessel equipped with upgradable active and passive abilities. Go on action-filled runs and battle through hordes of enemies to gather XP. Then level-up Circle in the meta-progression to become even stronger. Find the bosses in the procedurally generated levels and destroy them.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Actively control up to 4 abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ active &amp; passive abilities to get during runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">65+ permanent upgrades to Circle in the survivors-like meta-progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">25+ milestones that  unlock new features</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578190?t=1749252621","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578190?t=1749252621","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578190/c6890053e7304896679302f0826ecbaad8cd24c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749252621","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578190/c6890053e7304896679302f0826ecbaad8cd24c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749252621","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_descri